  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vegetables for Income, Nutrition and Employment in Sudan (VINES), BN, Gazira &amp; Kassala States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase the production of and access to quality-assured seeds for farmers by Strengthening the capacity of farmers and farmers groups through cascade training and establishing Smallholder Vegetable Growers Groups. Enable farmers to receive subsidized vegetable seeds to smallholder farmers and build market systems through fostering aggregation, linking farmers or VBNs to input/output markets to aggregative fresh vegetable produce.</narrative>
  </description>
